
"smart_sources:docs/MIGRATION_PLAYBOOK.md": {"path":"docs/MIGRATION_PLAYBOOK.md","embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05028921,-0.03979046,0.05253424,-0.07456873,0.00288295,0.02850949,-0.08531637,-0.03582198,0.03610939,0.01151439,-0.02147609,-0.09304304,-0.00413741,0.00973683,0.01481049,-0.023676,-0.01156798,0.02227551,-0.02574573,-0.00668458,0.0210329,0.01580774,0.00544572,0.00062472,0.02487783,0.06672516,0.01646073,-0.06553353,-0.10826833,-0.25865456,-0.01356172,-0.00344109,-0.02608175,0.03763166,0.00948831,-0.00862741,-0.0019435,-0.01334421,0.03746548,0.05851744,0.03338014,0.05618867,-0.00698683,-0.02953177,-0.0469931,-0.04908903,-0.01045692,0.01943068,0.00054644,0.01704346,-0.06232183,-0.00419758,-0.03318896,0.01564659,-0.00702386,0.07164886,0.07611416,0.06690458,0.01913554,0.06231798,0.09934861,0.00419429,-0.22346203,0.0372874,-0.00557383,0.01604152,-0.02465322,-0.00711845,-0.039025,0.05356256,-0.05788868,-0.03411408,0.06292085,0.09634484,0.04355255,0.01417462,-0.00248002,-0.02079949,-0.00721788,0.01225322,0.02097541,0.04332351,-0.06932729,0.01362705,-0.03549196,-0.04085331,0.02374688,-0.00895174,0.03045685,0.02584235,-0.05164674,0.00301101,0.0918784,0.04272351,-0.0565828,-0.03124035,-0.00247125,0.05006536,-0.01735661,0.09993254,0.00512401,-0.02402095,0.02484191,0.02380403,-0.00520679,-0.00354781,0.03861827,-0.07457706,0.00872063,0.02897204,-0.05687493,-0.02094951,0.00623613,-0.01597565,-0.0094621,0.01725473,0.01443152,-0.00541924,0.04001873,0.02648838,-0.0133636,0.01060127,0.10598683,-0.07989767,0.02667501,-0.04157704,0.06946637,0.05496638,0.0173894,0.06539971,0.02224267,0.01908181,-0.06434491,-0.02876081,-0.00092407,0.01109232,0.02019833,0.0038965,-0.02743183,-0.00583269,-0.03957646,-0.07943339,0.05812678,-0.07502844,-0.07716099,0.11476928,0.03165435,0.03595194,-0.00378609,-0.03602927,-0.00570807,0.02374447,-0.02622135,-0.03842003,-0.01588867,0.03170016,0.05536683,0.08977354,-0.11072,-0.00549241,-0.04185739,-0.0809529,-0.01759072,0.15978673,-0.00447763,-0.10382437,0.00471748,0.10415435,0.00624186,-0.05158011,0.02942372,-0.04172838,-0.04142432,0.00693402,0.07459938,-0.01602546,-0.00353162,0.01084259,-0.063056,-0.0135601,0.03189697,-0.08413003,-0.03690395,0.01579995,-0.00244406,-0.00834057,-0.08643547,-0.02189853,0.03774678,-0.01576704,-0.06924409,-0.01794646,0.00586405,-0.01781577,0.02301525,-0.0308646,-0.07442964,-0.01299535,0.03538725,-0.03612072,0.11526199,0.06248756,0.03552963,-0.00007678,0.04758192,0.04367728,-0.08076456,0.02357927,0.01875837,0.02649142,-0.0712495,-0.02836404,0.05602111,0.02260851,0.01151277,-0.0124687,-0.00096877,0.02375107,-0.00556339,0.08246165,-0.04122285,-0.0051181,-0.00036348,-0.20264901,-0.01646178,-0.01841793,-0.02059759,0.01609623,0.00933894,0.02229558,-0.01879552,0.08348026,0.08288832,0.09970957,-0.03344938,-0.02680985,0.07141238,-0.05760036,0.03270898,-0.0654698,-0.00567101,-0.03091915,0.01860299,0.05709508,-0.00144936,-0.01034859,-0.01806425,0.01862375,-0.00541073,0.12492377,-0.01328449,0.05166467,-0.03120137,0.07490814,0.05410925,0.00639496,-0.03660295,0.0591942,0.01113513,0.03591591,-0.08039828,0.00102213,-0.02022422,0.02247494,0.04964036,0.05528729,-0.09695181,-0.02057423,-0.03803785,0.02384965,0.018746,-0.05568196,0.01152282,0.01502156,-0.01388812,0.00046612,0.02025923,0.01716307,-0.05279273,-0.05198622,0.0261334,-0.06213542,0.06524801,0.00845669,0.01064337,0.01105235,-0.02206363,0.04110174,0.0136514,-0.02789241,0.009269,0.01343253,-0.0327404,0.03987503,0.07570224,-0.01693544,0.00542354,0.05972945,0.00353358,0.00437654,-0.06090245,0.00063761,-0.03508484,0.0240167,-0.0139318,0.0257185,0.05192982,0.02570577,0.03642179,-0.00062436,-0.04457626,-0.00469044,-0.03327995,0.04918639,-0.03140505,-0.07036812,-0.02212393,0.01946434,-0.03075856,-0.27464613,0.02463525,0.00337425,0.01497028,-0.02039575,0.01428227,0.02971375,-0.01587757,-0.04994582,-0.0063393,0.03929532,0.06546978,-0.02069649,-0.01711021,-0.00270093,-0.01944951,0.05004334,0.02329745,0.10789829,-0.07449389,0.01988921,-0.02472061,0.20081252,-0.03389084,0.00668154,0.04862932,0.02767474,0.04487821,0.05491472,0.03682054,-0.06339862,0.02485815,0.12841818,-0.03053707,-0.0037686,0.0445117,-0.05907676,0.01546436,-0.00225195,-0.02554555,-0.04757471,0.01613825,0.04023037,0.00776507,0.01526707,-0.03562766,-0.02017131,-0.04205232,0.00029475,0.01525425,-0.04455378,-0.0226079,-0.00512646,-0.01208885,0.05605889,0.04439103,-0.00075509,0.0725517,-0.05579305,-0.02785605,0.00562413,-0.0396058,0.03058579,0.02144654,-0.01562087],"last_embed":{"hash":"34gqmg","tokens":451}}},"last_read":{"hash":"34gqmg","at":1774580806250},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1773447493334,"size":10382,"at":1774579781554,"hash":"34gqmg"},"blocks":{"#Playbook de Migração e Escalabilidade - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📋 Visão Geral\\n\\nEste documento fornece um guia passo-a-passo para migrar de uma arquitetura Single-Server para Multi-Tier sem downtime, com validações e rollback automático.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 Fases de Migração\\n\\n### Fase 1: Planejamento (1-2 semanas)\\n\\n#### 1.1 Avaliação do Sistema Atual\\n\\n```bash\\n# Coletar métricas do sistema atual\\n./scripts/collect-baseline-metrics.sh\\n\\n# Gerar relatório de capacidade\\n./scripts/capacity-report.sh\\n\\n# Resultado: baseline_metrics.json\\n```\\n\\n**Checklist:**\\n- [ ] Número de alunos ativos\\n- [ ] Número de câmeras\\n- [ ] Picos de uso (horários)\\n- [ ] Taxa de crescimento esperada\\n- [ ] Requisitos de uptime\\n- [ ] Orçamento disponível\\n\\n#### 1.2 Seleção de Arquitetura\\n\\n```\\nSe alunos <= 250:\\n  → Manter Single-Server\\n  → Adicionar backup automático\\n  → Implementar monitoramento\\n\\nSe 250 < alunos <= 500:\\n  → Migrar para Multi-Tier\\n  → 3-5 servidores\\n  → Load balancer Nginx\\n  → MySQL replicado\\n\\nSe alunos > 500:\\n  → Considerar Microserviços\\n  → Kubernetes cluster\\n  → Escalabilidade automática\\n```\\n\\n#### 1.3 Dimensionamento de Hardware\\n\\n```bash\\n# Usar calculadora de requisitos\\nnode scripts/calculate-requirements.js \\\\\\n  --students 250 \\\\\\n  --cameras 8 \\\\\\n  --periods 3\\n\\n# Resultado: hardware-spec.json\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 2: Preparação (1 semana)\\n\\n#### 2.1 Provisionar Infraestrutura\\n\\n```bash\\n# Criar servidores de produção\\nterraform apply -var=\\\"environment=production\\\"\\n\\n# Resultado: 3-5 servidores provisionados\\n```\\n\\n**Servidores necessários:**\\n- 1x Load Balancer (Nginx)\\n- 2x Servidor de Processamento de Vídeo\\n- 1x Servidor de Reconhecimento Facial\\n- 1x Servidor de Banco de Dados (Master)\\n- 1x Servidor de Banco de Dados (Slave/Backup)\\n\\n#### 2.2 Configurar Banco de Dados\\n\\n```bash\\n# Criar banco de dados de produção\\nmysql -h prod-db-master.internal < schema.sql\\n\\n# Configurar replicação\\nmysql -h prod-db-master.internal < replication-master.sql\\nmysql -h prod-db-slave.internal < replication-slave.sql\\n\\n# Validar replicação\\n./scripts/validate-replication.sh\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.3 Configurar Cache Distribuído\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar Redis Cluster\\nredis-cli --cluster create \\\\\\n  prod-cache-1:6379 \\\\\\n  prod-cache-2:6379 \\\\\\n  prod-cache-3:6379\\n\\n# Validar cluster\\nredis-cli -h prod-cache-1 cluster info\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.4 Configurar Load Balancer\\n\\n```nginx\\n# /etc/nginx/sites-available/aquila-pro\\n\\nupstream video_servers {\\n  server prod-video-1:3000 weight=1;\\n  server prod-video-2:3000 weight=1;\\n  health_check interval=5s fails=2 passes=2;\\n}\\n\\nupstream face_servers {\\n  server prod-face-1:3001 weight=1;\\n  health_check interval=5s fails=2 passes=2;\\n}\\n\\nserver {\\n  listen 80;\\n  server_name aquila-pro.com.br;\\n\\n  location /api/video {\\n    proxy_pass http://video_servers;\\n    proxy_http_version 1.1;\\n    proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;\\n    proxy_set_header Connection \\\"upgrade\\\";\\n  }\\n\\n  location /api/face {\\n    proxy_pass http://face_servers;\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 3: Migração de Dados (1-2 dias)\\n\\n#### 3.1 Backup do Sistema Atual\\n\\n```bash\\n# Fazer backup completo do banco de dados\\nmysqldump -u root -p aquila_pro > backup-$(date +%Y%m%d).sql\\n\\n# Fazer backup de arquivos\\ntar -czf files-backup-$(date +%Y%m%d).tar.gz /var/aquila-pro/\\n\\n# Verificar integridade\\nmd5sum backup-*.sql > checksums.md5\\n```\\n\\n#### 3.2 Importar Dados para Produção\\n\\n```bash\\n# Importar banco de dados\\nmysql -h prod-db-master.internal aquila_pro < backup-20260304.sql\\n\\n# Validar dados\\n./scripts/validate-data-integrity.sh\\n\\n# Resultado: Todos os dados migrados com sucesso\\n```\\n\\n#### 3.3 Sincronizar Arquivos\\n\\n```bash\\n# Copiar arquivos para storage compartilhado\\nrsync -avz /var/aquila-pro/data/ nfs://prod-storage:/aquila-pro/\\n\\n# Validar sincronização\\nfind /var/aquila-pro/data -type f -exec md5sum {} \\\\; | \\\\\\n  sort | md5sum > local.md5\\n\\nfind /mnt/nfs/aquila-pro -type f -exec md5sum {} \\\\; | \\\\\\n  sort | md5sum > remote.md5\\n\\ndiff local.md5 remote.md5\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 4: Testes (3-5 dias)\\n\\n#### 4.1 Testes Funcionais\\n\\n```bash\\n# Executar suite de testes\\npnpm test:e2e --environment=production\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Captura de vídeo\\n# ✓ Detecção de pessoas\\n# ✓ Reconhecimento facial\\n# ✓ Rastreamento de presença\\n# ✓ Geração de alertas\\n# ✓ Relatórios\\n```\\n\\n#### 4.2 Testes de Carga\\n\\n```bash\\n# Executar testes de carga\\nnode scripts/load-testing.js \\\\\\n  --scenario \\\"Escola Média (250 alunos)\\\" \\\\\\n  --duration 300 \\\\\\n  --ramp-up 60\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Latência < 500ms\\n# ✓ CPU < 75%\\n# ✓ RAM < 70%\\n# ✓ Taxa de sucesso > 95%\\n```\\n\\n#### 4.3 Testes de Failover\\n\\n```bash\\n# Simular falha de servidor\\nkill -9 $(pgrep -f \\\"prod-video-1\\\")\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Tráfego redirecionado automaticamente\\n# ✓ Sem perda de dados\\n# ✓ Sem interrupção de serviço\\n\\n# Recuperar servidor\\nservice aquila-pro restart\\n```\\n\\n#### 4.4 Testes de Backup/Restore\\n\\n```bash\\n# Testar restauração de backup\\nmysql -h test-db.internal aquila_pro < backup-20260304.sql\\n\\n# Validar dados\\n./scripts/validate-data-integrity.sh\\n\\n# Resultado: Backup restaurado com sucesso\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 5: Cutover (1 dia)\\n\\n#### 5.1 Preparar Cutover\\n\\n```bash\\n# Notificar usuários sobre manutenção\\n./scripts/send-notification.sh \\\\\\n  \\\"Manutenção programada: 22:00 - 23:00 (1 hora)\\\"\\n\\n# Aguardar fim do horário de pico\\nsleep 3600\\n```\\n\\n#### 5.2 Ativar Produção\\n\\n```bash\\n# Atualizar DNS para apontar para load balancer\\naws route53 change-resource-record-sets \\\\\\n  --hosted-zone-id Z123456 \\\\\\n  --change-batch file://dns-update.json\\n\\n# Aguardar propagação de DNS (5-10 minutos)\\nsleep 600\\n\\n# Validar tráfego\\ncurl -v https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/health\\n```\\n\\n#### 5.3 Monitorar Cutover\\n\\n```bash\\n# Monitorar métricas em tempo real\\nwatch -n 1 'curl -s https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/metrics | jq .'\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Tráfego sendo processado\\n# ✓ Sem erros\\n# ✓ Latência normal\\n# ✓ CPU/RAM dentro dos limites\\n```\\n\\n#### 5.4 Validar Funcionalidades\\n\\n```bash\\n# Teste manual completo\\n1. Fazer login\\n2. Visualizar dashboard\\n3. Verificar câmeras ativas\\n4. Gerar alerta manual\\n5. Gerar relatório\\n6. Fazer logout\\n\\n# Resultado: Todas as funcionalidades operando normalmente\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 6: Estabilização (1 semana)\\n\\n#### 6.1 Monitoramento Intensivo\\n\\n```bash\\n# Monitorar 24/7 durante primeira semana\\n./scripts/intensive-monitoring.sh\\n\\n# Alertas automáticos para:\\n# - CPU > 80%\\n# - RAM > 75%\\n# - Latência > 1000ms\\n# - Taxa de erro > 1%\\n```\\n\\n#### 6.2 Otimizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# Coletar dados de performance\\n./scripts/collect-performance-data.sh\\n\\n# Analisar e otimizar\\n./scripts/analyze-performance.sh > optimization-report.md\\n\\n# Aplicar otimizações\\n# - Ajustar tamanho de cache\\n# - Otimizar queries de banco de dados\\n# - Ajustar pool de conexões\\n```\\n\\n#### 6.3 Documentação\\n\\n```bash\\n# Documentar configuração final\\n./scripts/generate-documentation.sh > PRODUCTION_CONFIG.md\\n\\n# Criar runbooks\\n./scripts/create-runbooks.sh\\n\\n# Treinar equipe de operações\\n./scripts/schedule-training.sh\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 Rollback Plan\\n\\nSe algo der errado durante a migração:\\n\\n### Rollback Automático\\n\\n```bash\\n# Script de rollback automático\\n#!/bin/bash\\n\\necho \\\"🔄 Iniciando rollback...\\\"\\n\\n# 1. Atualizar DNS para apontar de volta para sistema antigo\\naws route53 change-resource-record-sets \\\\\\n  --hosted-zone-id Z123456 \\\\\\n  --change-batch file://dns-rollback.json\\n\\n# 2. Aguardar propagação de DNS\\nsleep 600\\n\\n# 3. Validar tráfego\\nif curl -f https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/health > /dev/null; then\\n  echo \\\"✅ Rollback bem-sucedido\\\"\\nelse\\n  echo \\\"❌ Rollback falhou\\\"\\n  exit 1\\nfi\\n\\n# 4. Notificar usuários\\n./scripts/send-notification.sh \\\"Sistema restaurado para versão anterior\\\"\\n```\\n\\n### Rollback Manual\\n\\n```bash\\n# Se o rollback automático falhar\\n\\n# 1. SSH no load balancer\\nssh admin@prod-lb.internal\\n\\n# 2. Atualizar configuração Nginx\\nvi /etc/nginx/sites-available/aquila-pro\\n# Mudar upstream para apontar para servidor antigo\\n\\n# 3. Recarregar Nginx\\nsudo systemctl reload nginx\\n\\n# 4. Validar\\ncurl -v https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/health\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Matriz de Decisão de Migração\\n\\n```\\nCritério                | Single-Server | Multi-Tier | Microserviços\\n────────────────────────┼───────────────┼────────────┼──────────────\\nAlunos                  | ≤ 250         | 250-500    | > 500\\nCâmeras                 | ≤ 5           | 8-15       | 30+\\nUptime Requerido        | 99.5%         | 99.9%      | 99.99%\\nTempo de Migração       | N/A           | 1-2 semanas| 2-4 semanas\\nComplexidade            | ⭐            | ⭐⭐⭐    | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\\nCusto                   | $$$           | $$$$$      | $$$$$$\\nRisco de Downtime       | Alto          | Médio      | Baixo\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚨 Checklist de Migração\\n\\n### Pré-Migração\\n- [ ] Aprovação de stakeholders\\n- [ ] Orçamento aprovado\\n- [ ] Hardware provisionado\\n- [ ] Backups completos realizados\\n- [ ] Plano de rollback documentado\\n- [ ] Equipe treinada\\n- [ ] Janela de manutenção agendada\\n\\n### Durante Migração\\n- [ ] Backup do sistema atual\\n- [ ] Dados importados com sucesso\\n- [ ] Testes funcionais passando\\n- [ ] Testes de carga passando\\n- [ ] Testes de failover passando\\n- [ ] DNS atualizado\\n- [ ] Tráfego redirecionado\\n- [ ] Monitoramento ativo\\n\\n### Pós-Migração\\n- [ ] Todas as funcionalidades validadas\\n- [ ] Métricas de performance normais\\n- [ ] Alertas configurados\\n- [ ] Documentação atualizada\\n- [ ] Equipe treinada\\n- [ ] Plano de otimização iniciado\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte Durante Migração\\n\\n**Equipe de Suporte 24/7:**\\n- Telefone: +55 (11) 3000-0000\\n- Email: support@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Chat: https://aquilapro.com.br/chat\\n\\n**Escalation:**\\n1. Suporte Técnico (1ª linha)\\n2. Engenheiro de Infraestrutura (2ª linha)\\n3. Arquiteto de Sistemas (3ª linha)\\n4. VP de Engenharia (4ª linha)\\n":[1,2]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"34gqmg","at":1774580806144}},"smart_blocks:docs/MIGRATION_PLAYBOOK.md#Playbook de Migração e Escalabilidade - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📋 Visão Geral\\n\\nEste documento fornece um guia passo-a-passo para migrar de uma arquitetura Single-Server para Multi-Tier sem downtime, com validações e rollback automático.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 Fases de Migração\\n\\n### Fase 1: Planejamento (1-2 semanas)\\n\\n#### 1.1 Avaliação do Sistema Atual\\n\\n```bash\\n# Coletar métricas do sistema atual\\n./scripts/collect-baseline-metrics.sh\\n\\n# Gerar relatório de capacidade\\n./scripts/capacity-report.sh\\n\\n# Resultado: baseline_metrics.json\\n```\\n\\n**Checklist:**\\n- [ ] Número de alunos ativos\\n- [ ] Número de câmeras\\n- [ ] Picos de uso (horários)\\n- [ ] Taxa de crescimento esperada\\n- [ ] Requisitos de uptime\\n- [ ] Orçamento disponível\\n\\n#### 1.2 Seleção de Arquitetura\\n\\n```\\nSe alunos <= 250:\\n  → Manter Single-Server\\n  → Adicionar backup automático\\n  → Implementar monitoramento\\n\\nSe 250 < alunos <= 500:\\n  → Migrar para Multi-Tier\\n  → 3-5 servidores\\n  → Load balancer Nginx\\n  → MySQL replicado\\n\\nSe alunos > 500:\\n  → Considerar Microserviços\\n  → Kubernetes cluster\\n  → Escalabilidade automática\\n```\\n\\n#### 1.3 Dimensionamento de Hardware\\n\\n```bash\\n# Usar calculadora de requisitos\\nnode scripts/calculate-requirements.js \\\\\\n  --students 250 \\\\\\n  --cameras 8 \\\\\\n  --periods 3\\n\\n# Resultado: hardware-spec.json\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 2: Preparação (1 semana)\\n\\n#### 2.1 Provisionar Infraestrutura\\n\\n```bash\\n# Criar servidores de produção\\nterraform apply -var=\\\"environment=production\\\"\\n\\n# Resultado: 3-5 servidores provisionados\\n```\\n\\n**Servidores necessários:**\\n- 1x Load Balancer (Nginx)\\n- 2x Servidor de Processamento de Vídeo\\n- 1x Servidor de Reconhecimento Facial\\n- 1x Servidor de Banco de Dados (Master)\\n- 1x Servidor de Banco de Dados (Slave/Backup)\\n\\n#### 2.2 Configurar Banco de Dados\\n\\n```bash\\n# Criar banco de dados de produção\\nmysql -h prod-db-master.internal < schema.sql\\n\\n# Configurar replicação\\nmysql -h prod-db-master.internal < replication-master.sql\\nmysql -h prod-db-slave.internal < replication-slave.sql\\n\\n# Validar replicação\\n./scripts/validate-replication.sh\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.3 Configurar Cache Distribuído\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar Redis Cluster\\nredis-cli --cluster create \\\\\\n  prod-cache-1:6379 \\\\\\n  prod-cache-2:6379 \\\\\\n  prod-cache-3:6379\\n\\n# Validar cluster\\nredis-cli -h prod-cache-1 cluster info\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.4 Configurar Load Balancer\\n\\n```nginx\\n# /etc/nginx/sites-available/aquila-pro\\n\\nupstream video_servers {\\n  server prod-video-1:3000 weight=1;\\n  server prod-video-2:3000 weight=1;\\n  health_check interval=5s fails=2 passes=2;\\n}\\n\\nupstream face_servers {\\n  server prod-face-1:3001 weight=1;\\n  health_check interval=5s fails=2 passes=2;\\n}\\n\\nserver {\\n  listen 80;\\n  server_name aquila-pro.com.br;\\n\\n  location /api/video {\\n    proxy_pass http://video_servers;\\n    proxy_http_version 1.1;\\n    proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;\\n    proxy_set_header Connection \\\"upgrade\\\";\\n  }\\n\\n  location /api/face {\\n    proxy_pass http://face_servers;\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 3: Migração de Dados (1-2 dias)\\n\\n#### 3.1 Backup do Sistema Atual\\n\\n```bash\\n# Fazer backup completo do banco de dados\\nmysqldump -u root -p aquila_pro > backup-$(date +%Y%m%d).sql\\n\\n# Fazer backup de arquivos\\ntar -czf files-backup-$(date +%Y%m%d).tar.gz /var/aquila-pro/\\n\\n# Verificar integridade\\nmd5sum backup-*.sql > checksums.md5\\n```\\n\\n#### 3.2 Importar Dados para Produção\\n\\n```bash\\n# Importar banco de dados\\nmysql -h prod-db-master.internal aquila_pro < backup-20260304.sql\\n\\n# Validar dados\\n./scripts/validate-data-integrity.sh\\n\\n# Resultado: Todos os dados migrados com sucesso\\n```\\n\\n#### 3.3 Sincronizar Arquivos\\n\\n```bash\\n# Copiar arquivos para storage compartilhado\\nrsync -avz /var/aquila-pro/data/ nfs://prod-storage:/aquila-pro/\\n\\n# Validar sincronização\\nfind /var/aquila-pro/data -type f -exec md5sum {} \\\\; | \\\\\\n  sort | md5sum > local.md5\\n\\nfind /mnt/nfs/aquila-pro -type f -exec md5sum {} \\\\; | \\\\\\n  sort | md5sum > remote.md5\\n\\ndiff local.md5 remote.md5\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 4: Testes (3-5 dias)\\n\\n#### 4.1 Testes Funcionais\\n\\n```bash\\n# Executar suite de testes\\npnpm test:e2e --environment=production\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Captura de vídeo\\n# ✓ Detecção de pessoas\\n# ✓ Reconhecimento facial\\n# ✓ Rastreamento de presença\\n# ✓ Geração de alertas\\n# ✓ Relatórios\\n```\\n\\n#### 4.2 Testes de Carga\\n\\n```bash\\n# Executar testes de carga\\nnode scripts/load-testing.js \\\\\\n  --scenario \\\"Escola Média (250 alunos)\\\" \\\\\\n  --duration 300 \\\\\\n  --ramp-up 60\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Latência < 500ms\\n# ✓ CPU < 75%\\n# ✓ RAM < 70%\\n# ✓ Taxa de sucesso > 95%\\n```\\n\\n#### 4.3 Testes de Failover\\n\\n```bash\\n# Simular falha de servidor\\nkill -9 $(pgrep -f \\\"prod-video-1\\\")\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Tráfego redirecionado automaticamente\\n# ✓ Sem perda de dados\\n# ✓ Sem interrupção de serviço\\n\\n# Recuperar servidor\\nservice aquila-pro restart\\n```\\n\\n#### 4.4 Testes de Backup/Restore\\n\\n```bash\\n# Testar restauração de backup\\nmysql -h test-db.internal aquila_pro < backup-20260304.sql\\n\\n# Validar dados\\n./scripts/validate-data-integrity.sh\\n\\n# Resultado: Backup restaurado com sucesso\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 5: Cutover (1 dia)\\n\\n#### 5.1 Preparar Cutover\\n\\n```bash\\n# Notificar usuários sobre manutenção\\n./scripts/send-notification.sh \\\\\\n  \\\"Manutenção programada: 22:00 - 23:00 (1 hora)\\\"\\n\\n# Aguardar fim do horário de pico\\nsleep 3600\\n```\\n\\n#### 5.2 Ativar Produção\\n\\n```bash\\n# Atualizar DNS para apontar para load balancer\\naws route53 change-resource-record-sets \\\\\\n  --hosted-zone-id Z123456 \\\\\\n  --change-batch file://dns-update.json\\n\\n# Aguardar propagação de DNS (5-10 minutos)\\nsleep 600\\n\\n# Validar tráfego\\ncurl -v https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/health\\n```\\n\\n#### 5.3 Monitorar Cutover\\n\\n```bash\\n# Monitorar métricas em tempo real\\nwatch -n 1 'curl -s https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/metrics | jq .'\\n\\n# Validar:\\n# ✓ Tráfego sendo processado\\n# ✓ Sem erros\\n# ✓ Latência normal\\n# ✓ CPU/RAM dentro dos limites\\n```\\n\\n#### 5.4 Validar Funcionalidades\\n\\n```bash\\n# Teste manual completo\\n1. Fazer login\\n2. Visualizar dashboard\\n3. Verificar câmeras ativas\\n4. Gerar alerta manual\\n5. Gerar relatório\\n6. Fazer logout\\n\\n# Resultado: Todas as funcionalidades operando normalmente\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Fase 6: Estabilização (1 semana)\\n\\n#### 6.1 Monitoramento Intensivo\\n\\n```bash\\n# Monitorar 24/7 durante primeira semana\\n./scripts/intensive-monitoring.sh\\n\\n# Alertas automáticos para:\\n# - CPU > 80%\\n# - RAM > 75%\\n# - Latência > 1000ms\\n# - Taxa de erro > 1%\\n```\\n\\n#### 6.2 Otimizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# Coletar dados de performance\\n./scripts/collect-performance-data.sh\\n\\n# Analisar e otimizar\\n./scripts/analyze-performance.sh > optimization-report.md\\n\\n# Aplicar otimizações\\n# - Ajustar tamanho de cache\\n# - Otimizar queries de banco de dados\\n# - Ajustar pool de conexões\\n```\\n\\n#### 6.3 Documentação\\n\\n```bash\\n# Documentar configuração final\\n./scripts/generate-documentation.sh > PRODUCTION_CONFIG.md\\n\\n# Criar runbooks\\n./scripts/create-runbooks.sh\\n\\n# Treinar equipe de operações\\n./scripts/schedule-training.sh\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 Rollback Plan\\n\\nSe algo der errado durante a migração:\\n\\n### Rollback Automático\\n\\n```bash\\n# Script de rollback automático\\n#!/bin/bash\\n\\necho \\\"🔄 Iniciando rollback...\\\"\\n\\n# 1. Atualizar DNS para apontar de volta para sistema antigo\\naws route53 change-resource-record-sets \\\\\\n  --hosted-zone-id Z123456 \\\\\\n  --change-batch file://dns-rollback.json\\n\\n# 2. Aguardar propagação de DNS\\nsleep 600\\n\\n# 3. Validar tráfego\\nif curl -f https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/health > /dev/null; then\\n  echo \\\"✅ Rollback bem-sucedido\\\"\\nelse\\n  echo \\\"❌ Rollback falhou\\\"\\n  exit 1\\nfi\\n\\n# 4. Notificar usuários\\n./scripts/send-notification.sh \\\"Sistema restaurado para versão anterior\\\"\\n```\\n\\n### Rollback Manual\\n\\n```bash\\n# Se o rollback automático falhar\\n\\n# 1. SSH no load balancer\\nssh admin@prod-lb.internal\\n\\n# 2. Atualizar configuração Nginx\\nvi /etc/nginx/sites-available/aquila-pro\\n# Mudar upstream para apontar para servidor antigo\\n\\n# 3. Recarregar Nginx\\nsudo systemctl reload nginx\\n\\n# 4. Validar\\ncurl -v https://aquila-pro.com.br/api/health\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Matriz de Decisão de Migração\\n\\n```\\nCritério                | Single-Server | Multi-Tier | Microserviços\\n────────────────────────┼───────────────┼────────────┼──────────────\\nAlunos                  | ≤ 250         | 250-500    | > 500\\nCâmeras                 | ≤ 5           | 8-15       | 30+\\nUptime Requerido        | 99.5%         | 99.9%      | 99.99%\\nTempo de Migração       | N/A           | 1-2 semanas| 2-4 semanas\\nComplexidade            | ⭐            | ⭐⭐⭐    | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\\nCusto                   | $$$           | $$$$$      | $$$$$$\\nRisco de Downtime       | Alto          | Médio      | Baixo\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚨 Checklist de Migração\\n\\n### Pré-Migração\\n- [ ] Aprovação de stakeholders\\n- [ ] Orçamento aprovado\\n- [ ] Hardware provisionado\\n- [ ] Backups completos realizados\\n- [ ] Plano de rollback documentado\\n- [ ] Equipe treinada\\n- [ ] Janela de manutenção agendada\\n\\n### Durante Migração\\n- [ ] Backup do sistema atual\\n- [ ] Dados importados com sucesso\\n- [ ] Testes funcionais passando\\n- [ ] Testes de carga passando\\n- [ ] Testes de failover passando\\n- [ ] DNS atualizado\\n- [ ] Tráfego redirecionado\\n- [ ] Monitoramento ativo\\n\\n### Pós-Migração\\n- [ ] Todas as funcionalidades validadas\\n- [ ] Métricas de performance normais\\n- [ ] Alertas configurados\\n- [ ] Documentação atualizada\\n- [ ] Equipe treinada\\n- [ ] Plano de otimização iniciado\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte Durante Migração\\n\\n**Equipe de Suporte 24/7:**\\n- Telefone: +55 (11) 3000-0000\\n- Email: support@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Chat: https://aquilapro.com.br/chat\\n\\n**Escalation:**\\n1. Suporte Técnico (1ª linha)\\n2. Engenheiro de Infraestrutura (2ª linha)\\n3. Arquiteto de Sistemas (3ª linha)\\n4. VP de Engenharia (4ª linha)\\n": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"Tay